## 2. File System Architecture Blueprint (Separation of Concerns)

```text
TutorKeyBox01/
 ├── Source/
 │    ├── Core/                   # Application Lifecycle & Data Models
 │    │    ├── HeadlessMain.cpp   # Pi Daemon Main Entry Point
 │    │    ├── Main.cpp           # Mac GUI Desktop Entry Point
 │    │    ├── MidiState.h        # Polyphonic Note Tracking
 │    │    └── PresetManager.h/.cpp # JSON Preset Serialization
 │    │
 │    ├── Audio/                  # Audio Hardware Device Drivers
 │    │    ├── AudioEngine.h/.cpp # CoreAudio (Mac) / ALSA (Pi) Device Manager
 │    │
 │    ├── Synth/                  # Pure DSP & Synthesiser Core (0% GUI Dependency)
 │    │    ├── LayeredSynth.h/.cpp# 4-Layer Polyphonic Synthesiser
 │    │    ├── CustomSamplerVoice # SIMD Sample Interpolation & Voice Allocation
 │    │    ├── CustomSamplerSound # Mapped Sample Region Descriptors
 │    │    ├── SampleContainerReader # Read-Only mmap Container Stream
 │    │    └── SamplePackager.h   # WAV-to-BIN Container Generator
 │    │
 │    ├── Network/                # Cross-Platform Communication Protocols
 │    │    ├── NetworkProtocol.h  # Packed Binary Struct Schemas (UDP/TCP)
 │    │    ├── DeployClient.h/.cpp# Mac GUI Preset Deployment Client (TCP 7778)
 │    │    ├── DeployServer.h/.cpp# Pi Daemon Preset Deployment Server (TCP 7778)
 │    │    └── NetworkServer.h/.cpp# Pi Telemetry & Control Server (UDP 7777)
 │    │
 │    └── GUI/                    # Mac Desktop Presentation Layer (Mac Only)
 │         ├── MainComponent.h/.cpp # Main Window Container
 │         ├── DeployControlBar   # Status Indicator & Deploy Trigger
 │         ├── HardwareSelectorBar# Audio & MIDI Input Device Selectors
 │         ├── LayerCardComponent # Modular Layer Card (Volume, Mute, Drag&Drop)
 │         └── TelemetryHeaderView# CPU Usage & Active Voice Counter
```

